{"path":"experimental/fs/path/begin","title":"std::experimental::filesystem::path::begin, std::experimental::filesystem::path::end","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::filesystem::path::</span>begin, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::filesystem::path::</span>end","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/fs/path/begin","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"The sequence denoted by this pair of iterators consists of the following:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-fs_ts\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">iterator begin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-fs-ts t-mark-ts\">(filesystem TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-fs_ts\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">iterator end<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-fs-ts t-mark-ts\">(filesystem TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Returns an iterator to the first element of the path. If the path is empty, the returned iterator is equal to <span class=\"t-lc\"><strong class=\"selflink\">end()</strong></span>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Returns an iterator one past the last element of the path. Dereferencing this iterator is undefined behavior.</div>\n<p>The sequence denoted by this pair of iterators consists of the following:\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> <span class=\"t-spar\">root-name</span> (if any).</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> <span class=\"t-spar\">root-directory</span> (if any).</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Sequence of <span class=\"t-spar\">file-name</span>s, omitting any directory separators.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> If there is a directory separator after the last <span class=\"t-spar\">file-name</span> in the path, the last element before the end iterator is a fictitious <span class=\"t-spar\">dot</span> file name.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Iterator to the first element of the path.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Iterator one past the end of the path.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;experimental/filesystem&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> fs <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">filesystem</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">path</span> p <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"C:<span class=\"es1\">\\\\</span>users<span class=\"es1\">\\\\</span>abcdef<span class=\"es1\">\\\\</span>AppData<span class=\"es1\">\\\\</span>Local<span class=\"es1\">\\\\</span>Temp<span class=\"es1\">\\\\</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Examining the path \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> p <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" through iterators gives<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> e <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> p<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> e <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Examining the path \"C:\\users\\abcdef\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\\" through iterators gives\n\"C:\"\n\"/\"\n\"users\"\n\"abcdef\"\n\"AppData\"\n\"Local\"\n\"Temp\"\n\".\"</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/fs","title":"Filesystem library"},{"path":"experimental/fs/path","title":"std::experimental::filesystem::path"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::filesystem::path::begin, std::experimental::filesystem::path::end","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Returns an iterator to the first element of the path. If the path is empty, the returned iterator is equal to end()."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Iterator to the first element of the path."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":191,"codeBlockCount":2}
